'''Dizana's quiver''' is an item that requires level 75 [[Ranged]] to equip. It provides the [[best in slot]] ranged attack bonus for the cape slot, and is awarded for defeating [[Sol Heredit]] in the [[Fortis Colosseum]].

The quiver is one of many used by fighters in the Fortis Colosseum, made as replicas of the original that was used by [[Dizana]], the Heroine of the Hunt; one of these replicas is found as [[Dizana's Quiver (scenery)|a display]] in the [[Grand Museum]]. The whereabouts of the original quiver is a heavily debated topic among Varlamorians; while assumed by many to be lost, some believe that the original quiver is mixed in with the replicas used in the Fortis Colosseum.{{CiteText|text=Dizana's Quiver (scenery)|quote=The status of the original quiver is heavily debated. Many claim that it has long been lost, while others believe it exists among the replicas being used within the Colosseum.}}

Quivers can also be brought to [[Minimus]] to be exchanged for either 4,000 [[sunfire splinters]] or a 1/200 chance at receiving [[Smol Heredit]] (if not already in the player's possession), giving the item an indirect value of {{Coins|{{GEP|Sunfire splinters|4000}}}}. Players can configure the charges while the quiver is in their bank by right-clicking on Configure-Charges, as long as players have the required materials.

